%p
  #{@signup.user.full_name}, Get Stoked!
  %br/
  #{@added_by.full_name} added you to the upcoming Cragmont trip.
  %br/
  = @waiver_instruction
  %br/
  You can do that here:
  = link_to "Waiver Link", @waiver_url
  \.

%p
  See you at the Crag.
  %br/
  Cragmont Climbing Club

- if @signup.user.default_password?
  %p
    One more thing. We setup an account for you in case you want to sign up for future trips.
    %br/
    If you want to log in go through the Password Reset flow to set a password.
    %br/
    = link_to "Password Reset Link", @password_reset_url
